<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes money market injection.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes money market injection.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the single credit auction whereby it had sought to inject 755 million pesos into the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was placed as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    755 million    1 day   24.72 pct</p>
<p>(Amount in pesos)</p>
<p>((--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
